  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/villagerdrop/villagerdrop-1.12.2/-/raw/main/images/preview.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1005\">&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"color:#999\"><br></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Добавляем дроп для жителей!</strong></p>\n<p>Некоторые продукты обладают эффектами зелий и имеют шанс их получения.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">Обычные предметы:</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#000\">Изумруд <span style=\"color:#999\">(0~2)</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/villagerdrop/villagerdrop-1.12.2/-/raw/main/images/emerald.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#000\">Часть жителя <span style=\"color:#999\">(1~3)</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#999\"><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/villagerdrop/villagerdrop-1.12.2/-/raw/main/src/main/resources/assets/villagerdrop/textures/items/piece_of_villager.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></span></span></p>\n<p><strong>Редкие предметы: <span style=\"color:#999\">(Если повезёт, можно выбить редкий предмет, при этом выпадает только один вид за раз.)</span><br></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Сок жителя&reg;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#999\">(1~2)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/villagerdrop/villagerdrop-1.12.2/-/raw/main/src/main/resources/assets/villagerdrop/textures/items/villager_juice.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Энергетик жителя&reg;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#999\">(1~2)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/villagerdrop/villagerdrop-1.12.2/-/raw/main/src/main/resources/assets/villagerdrop/textures/items/villager_energy_drink.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Пиво жителя&reg;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#999\">(1~2)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/villagerdrop/villagerdrop-1.12.2/-/raw/main/src/main/resources/assets/villagerdrop/textures/items/villager_beer.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Вино жителя&reg;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#999\">(1~2)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/villagerdrop/villagerdrop-1.12.2/-/raw/main/src/main/resources/assets/villagerdrop/textures/items/villager_wine.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
